{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material","id":1103261,"title":"Mario is a Lunar? Translation and evolution and type of inspirational source material","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-13T14:02:15-07:00","id":1103261,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Mario is a Lunar? Translation and evolution and type of inspirational source material","content":"People have noted translating a character to the system is always challenging.<br /> <br /> e3 is in swing and is inspiring me in weird ways. Mario has showed up with a new gimmick. This time he's meeting in the world of woman he shares an ambiguous connection to that can help him on his journey to power the means to track the rescue of his regular cake baker and go karting and golf partner from Bowser as he uses similar stolen power to force Peach to marry him and rule the world.<br /> ...<br /> Okay seriously!!!<br /> <br /> Actually the &quot;sameness&quot; helps lead to games LIKE exalted and the idea of a being being an incarnation of role/spirit. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eternal_Champion\" target=\"_blank\">The Eternal Champion</a>. Or <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saber_(Fate/stay_night)\" target=\"_blank\">The King Sent to Unite Britain</a>. Etc.<br /> <br /> Still you often have to choose how you want to engage in what with your character from their inspiration. This is especially tough when you want them to function not just in spirit but actual effectiveness in system. For a bit Dawn Cast was a suckers game. Solars are powered by specializing and unless you chose poorly you didn't need five abilities being favored in pure combat capability. But what else would you cal<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1095058-samurai-jack\">l a wandering warrior and master of all combat and skills sent to fight the enemies of light and humanity </a><br /> <br /> In the latest Mario Odyssey trail the portabello plumber shows the ability to possess...damn near anything. People, stone statues, traffic cones, vehicles! Now as typical this enhancement is granted by a helper, Cappy, a wispy spirit who has possessed Mario's cap to help aid in ability and give him this skill, along with a ranged attack and double jumping ability.<br /> <br /> My subject line, now that I think about it, is rather wrong. From his overall freeness of posession and loss of self and need to insert in stories and collect ambient things that are common and important but for him souls-essence he's really more of a Rakhasa than a Lunar. Still with his introduction as a man taking tools against a beast who's taken a girl AND causing disaster he seemed, to me the Brawl Master (with a few dips into Melee and other things for hammers and such though he's never a MASTER of these just a user) Solar Exalted (hilariously Eclipse or Night he just lacks versatility and combat badassery to be a Dawn and is no prophet and definitely not a Doctor, Engineer, or Sage so not a Twilight). I suppose if you think &quot;lesser power or underdog&quot; is more important Fire Aspect. hehehehehehehehe. I remember on the ooooold forums, no even OLDER, but not the oldest, said Kenshin Homura couldn't be a Solar but a Wood Aspect, maybe with a hax martial art.<br /> So basically you see one aspect of the translation issue. Even if you are not dealing with a character who's constantly changing they will have multiple overlapping representatives or possible roles and you can't get everything out the gate OR have to lock out the potential.<br /> <br /> Basically just reacting and wonder if other boardfen are inspired by recent things to translate living or ongoing characters and what is best to emphasize and focus on.<br /> <br /> Another Example.<br /> Spiderman Classic. Seems perfectly suited for a Night Caste. Its his villains who are part Other. If he shapeshifts or leaves a 'pure' human existence, its a sign of him mutating or being corrupted. Even as he's evolved to be more organic as to &quot;it just works&quot; acrobat meets powerlifter meets minor gadgeteer with great danger/combat instincts...I don't think being part bug has been his thing so much as a curse or complication that flares up. I think JMS tried to idea of &quot;Spider Totem man&quot; but it didn't quite stick. aside from needing to hide his identity on the job he never leaves the human sphere and originally he often geared up with webshooters, tracers, spotlights, and so on. Not feeling intheme for a Lunar to make and equip advanced personal supertools to *disguise* or appear as an animal. The Movies emphasize the puberty or biological aspect and this is adapted into modern depictions. However I am sure <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar636_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"636\" data-vbnamecard=\"636\">Sunder the Gold</a> would feel Peter Parker isn't THAT out of place for a Lunar. He is the original motormouthed trickster. But he wouldn't work for the Getiminian Exalted either, right?<br /> <br /> Finally I'm thinking gear. I love translating Zelda's ability expanding tools into Exalted use. Exalted seemed to not mind either having Azrael's extendo claws in the Night Castebook and other devices reminiscent of comics, games, and pulps/fantasy. Even an Excalibur's scabbard expy. Or a take off the holy Grail being a blood and thus health provider. One thing I'm thinking of is Zelda's Gust Jar or Luigi's Poltergust 6000.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","user":"Darmani","date":". 06-13-2017, 05:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","name":"Darmani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1498_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T15:09:18-07:00","id":1103300,"title":"","content":"But, Mario is already in Exalted canon as No-key, the Mushroom King, the only mortal to ever defeat Octavian (Bowser)<br /> <br /> But translation is a big problem. You want a real tough one, try Batman. Is he a heroic mortal or a night caste? Either way pretty much ruins the character for somebody.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T15:38:00-07:00","id":1103309,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material?p=1103300#post1103300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But, Mario is already in Exalted canon as No-key, the Mushroom King, the only mortal to ever defeat Octavian (Bowser)<br /> <br /> But translation is a big problem. You want a real tough one, try Batman. Is he a heroic mortal or a night caste? Either way pretty much ruins the character for somebody.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not if exalted stop the RPG ISM so that all technology is gated behind significant characters. In other words if artifacts actually have powers as opposed to required Essence use. As such Batman could gather develop or invent various artifacts or devices and then utilize them but still be mortal. The same would go for mystical martial arts just make sure to pay willpower and translate it to Moats. It's a basic fix that takes care of all the problems with doing heroic mortal Batman. The problem is when he goes up against the absolute effects that litter exalted. In comic books there's usually some niggly reason why this or that works even when it really shouldn't period and exalted this is cut off so that we don't have to go extra super duper perfect attack to get past the extra super Perfect Defense. This however means that there are absolute tears of ability when it comes to who goes up against to ideally. In practice this doesn't really pan out because what really matters is who can do the most medium damage attacks at once. Also certain Splats are given priority in certain areas. Sometimes this isn't bad but when that's all encompassing of an area such as awareness or travel especially if it makes everything that comes before it can really make things difficult. Yes over a decade and a half later I'm still pissed off about first edition version of thesideral","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","name":"Darmani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1498_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T18:00:01-07:00","id":1103342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darmani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material?p=1103309#post1103309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a basic fix that takes care of <b>all the problems</b> with doing heroic mortal Batman.</div> </div> </div> </div>How does that fix the Batman being the world's greatest detective in a world with Exalts who can use Investigation Charms?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T19:11:21-07:00","id":1103356,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material?p=1103342#post1103342\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How does that fix the Batman being the world's greatest detective in a world with Exalts who can use Investigation Charms?</div> </div> </div> </div>For some it's more important that Batman does what he does without super powers in a world full of super powers than it is for him to be the best at something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T19:44:46-07:00","id":1103362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material?p=1103356#post1103356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For some it's more important that Batman does what he does without super powers in a world full of super powers than it is for him to be the best at something.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this is the tricky divide. id make batman a solar bc(w/my problems with batman aside) because he lacks overt superpowers, but clearly is leauges above human average and potential and I find that the main part of his character (Alla Holmes). Batmans mortality isn't like lex luthors for me, where it scentral.<br /> <br /> BUT I think placing batman as the mortal among gods is a totally valid interpretation! And exalted makes that trickier. I'd almost say make him the sole non-sorcerer, but Diana is also a non-sorcerer. And then there's squaring his gadgets with how artifacts work, bc there is a substantive difference between a utility belt and aquamans trident or wonder woman's lasso. Batman as mortal is...tricky.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I will also say that batman from a narrative perspective definetly has superpowers. His wealth and honed skills are extreme enough to be simialir as well as his vaunted preparatory skills.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":11835,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","user":"Epee102","date":". 06-13-2017, 10:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T20:28:17-07:00","id":1103371,"title":"","content":"With Batman (or any other similar character) you have to first decide which iteration you're looking at. Sometimes Batman in the comics Batman is basically just a street level hero, a smart, well trained guy who puts on a mask and punches robbers in the face. Other times he's the smartest guy in the universe who builds super-suits so he can fly through space and punch demigods in the face.<br /> <br /> Ultimately Batman tends to get by on narrative power rather than super powers. He's not nearly anywhere near as fast or strong as other superheroes or villains, but the story's narrative always introduces some way for him to keep up with those super strong, super fast people and to allow him to contribute when they fight enemies who would normally be well beyond a &quot;street level hero&quot; when they show up in his comics (or when he shows up in theirs).<br /> <br /> Which, of course, makes it impossible to perfectly translate Batman to a game like Exalted.<br /> <br /> Also Possession Mario seems like a Fair Folk or a Ghost (or rather his hat is a Fair Folk or a Ghost who is somehow lending him some of its power).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T21:29:29-07:00","id":1103377,"title":"","content":"Mario heroic ghost or... Abyssal?<br /> <br /> Yes I remember no key. The problem is its thing in game not born from rules. Like the humanity average elder who is scarface when that should degenerate him superfast","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","name":"Darmani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1498_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T22:29:27-07:00","id":1103391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material?p=1103342#post1103342\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How does that fix the Batman being the world's greatest detective in a world with Exalts who can use Investigation Charms?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;It's like those pizza places that claim to have the best pizza in the world. Y-what do you think, they have pizza contests? Have you ever been to a pizza contest?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T05:29:25-07:00","id":1103449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darmani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material#post1103261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Solar Exalted (hilariously Eclipse or Night he just lacks versatility and combat badassery to be a Dawn and is no prophet and definitely not a Doctor, Engineer, or Sage so not a Twilight).</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, technically Mario <i>is</i> a plumber, and has been a doctor... <i>albeit</i> one who practiced medicine by throwing blocks at viruses. However, <i>yeah,</i> the games usually showcase his Athletics more than his profession. Dodge and Larceny too, so...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T12:07:09-07:00","id":1103573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Greyman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material?p=1103449#post1103449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, technically Mario <i>is</i> a plumber, and has been a doctor... <i>albeit</i> one who practiced medicine by throwing blocks at viruses. However, <i>yeah,</i> the games usually showcase his Athletics more than his profession. Dodge and Larceny too, so...</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;I use Ailment Annihilating Smash to grab a rock and smack the dying leper so hard that it cures his leprosy. Then I follow it up with Face-Shattering Friendship Fist and punch the new cured leper in the face so hard he becomes my best friend.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Alright. Roll Dexterity + Athletics, and then follow it up with a Strength + Presence roll.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T13:36:33-07:00","id":1103598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material?p=1103573#post1103573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;I use Ailment Annihilating Smash to grab a rock and smack the dying leper so hard that it cures his leprosy. Then I follow it up with Face-Shattering Friendship Fist and punch the new cured leper in the face so hard he becomes my best friend.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Alright. Roll Dexterity + Athletics, and then follow it up with a Strength + Presence roll.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't see what was so incomprehensible about this. Most versions of Dr. Mario imply that he's throwing in various combination medicines into a jar that's filled with already existent diseases he's effectively trying to develop a type of medicine (or regimen) that's most effective against these common germs. The process is weird but well it's obviously gamified period so he's probably not really a doctor so much as he is, well,I guess, pharmacist is the wrong word but whoever it is that mixes matches and develops chemicals that are effective against certain diseases.<br /> so really it just be some form of I take a sample of a disease and then mix and match various healing items in order to create a super medicine that I know will cure the patient. I can easily see that being a solar charm especially as what's the longest that level last 10 15 20 minutes contrast and compare that the half-day or hours of testing that's in order to get a failure<br /> <br /> hell that could easily be a thaumaturgical procedure. It's basically just gamified how we make and mix medicines in order to figure out how to kill a disease in an effective way. The only thing you'd have to change to make it a little more reflective of life is instead of a jar to reflect the tetris Origins use a petri dish","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","user":"Darmani","date":". 06-15-2017, 02:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","name":"Darmani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1498_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-19T21:28:25-07:00","id":1105591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material?p=1103573#post1103573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &amp;quot;I use Ailment Annihilating Smash to grab a rock and smack the dying leper so hard that it cures his leprosy. Then I follow it up with Face-Shattering Friendship Fist and punch the new cured leper in the face so hard he becomes my best friend.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;Alright. Roll Dexterity + Athletics, and then follow it up with a Strength + Presence roll.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Literally punch the leprosy right off him. That is powerful imagery. I dig it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1199-mister-lion","name":"Mister Lion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1199_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-20T02:30:23-07:00","id":1105639,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/s/8107629/1/Mass-Effect-Glorious-Shotgun-Princess\" target=\"_blank\">What.</a><br /> <br /> 10 chars","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-20T03:56:47-07:00","id":1105644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1103261-mario-is-a-lunar-translation-and-evolution-and-type-of-inspirational-source-material?p=1103391#post1103391\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;It's like those pizza places that claim to have the best pizza in the world. Y-what do you think, they have pizza contests? Have you ever been to a pizza contest?&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes and yes to both questions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-21T19:04:38-07:00","id":1106366,"title":"","content":"Okay this is how you would do Dr. Mario in Exalted.<br /> <br /> I'm going to take an obscure artifact , the cup of blood or Goblet of blood I forget what it's called. Suffice to say this meant that it can generate lots of blood for just paying a single Essence mote. This got forgotten and/or rectconned the moment abyssals came out because basically it was an infinite mote provider without even the difficulty of you got to kill human beings. So turn that into, ya know healthlevels.<br /> The blood Grail or the Chalice of Blood was developed by Twilight doctors and physicians in order to Aid rituals involving the need of blood. It transforms Motes of essence into the vital life that can serve through any living being with something of a circulatory system. Anything inside of it is mostly sterile or will not provide or perpetuate any disease with meaning.<br /> It can also be used for analysis and extraction. Hold the bottom of the cup to a patient that you believe is Afflicted spend<br /> a mote and it will duplicate blood in the patient or useful for the patient.<br /> <br /> In cases where the Exalted could not use their ability to dismiss illness with just a touch they would then use this cup. Draw out the blood and then use it to sample the disease, analyzing it. They mix whatever medicines temperatures powders and herbs in order to understand and study to disease. During this time after they finish their mixture they would make blood inside of it that would be full of Curative. Then they could transfer this blood into their patient. The healthy blood complete with the knowledge and experience of how to kill the disease that was afflicting the patient with them being in the patient allowed them to be healed and proof against further affliction from that or derived matters.(take 1E Immunity to poison/disease and grant it to that specific curative permenantly. READ IT its not what it says on the tin)<br /> Presto! Finally a way that solars can actually make medicines and cures as well as do analysis with magical things. Or more accurately anyone with medicine or thaumaturgical background. Pretty good considering how medicine does have something of a Mythic tradition and some Eastern and Arabia cultures say nothing of course about the tale of what was that doctor I can't pronounce it anyway I think he was like the son of Apollo or something)<br /> This would not borin later eras. In addition to being rather grotesque looking it has the ability to cultivate diseases found in blood and various parts of the body. As well as was considered by some simply too easy even when it was contemporary. Before his untimely sickness Noki the Mushroom King actually use this as a hobby as a way to elevate his status amongst the exalted host. Being only Immortal Chieftain albeit favored by the gods and beloved by one of the exalted. It's this reason probably more than its Effectiveness that it never really caught on after the Fallen age of the usurpation. and would not be a common implement amongst first age hippocratic. Almost all that were made in creation are now the possession of the Death Lords who have distributed them amongst their knights, agents, or abyssals. And despite it's rather 'simple' function it's so powerful it's actually artifact level 4.<br /> <br /> Anyone that you find is very likely cursed that is to say having been in the possession of a death Lord it has any number of spells or spirits attached who know the track or retrieve it for their lord. They've had problems in the past with one or two uppity Hungry Ghost or Nimitz Aries or the pre Abyssal Death Knights trying to take one of these in order to make himself Godly with an infinite supply of blood to draw.<br /> okay I've got me a legend period but now how do I mechanically represent this in 2nd or 3rd Edition","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","user":"Darmani","date":". 06-28-2017, 01:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","name":"Darmani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1498_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-28T09:22:41-07:00","id":1108785,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exon767, post: 36565954, member: 104667</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jonah Hex/Yosemite Sam Special #1<br /> Don't piss off Yosemite Sam.<br /> Foghorn Leghorn the Pugilist. I have no words.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/h4C6Pyt.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LrqPXJL.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>This is ... a joke right. a parod.. no<br /> That's Foghorn there. And this looks like official artwork in that style<br /> <br /> ohmigawd.<br /> and he never reloads. I means I KNOW he doesn't. Just adaptations highlight certain shit. Those look like revolvers. I CAN COUNT THE CHAMBERS so with the constant shooting...<br /> <br /> How and what system would be best to stat up the effect of Yosemite Sam's guns?<br /> How would you make them work !!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1498-darmani","name":"Darmani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1498_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}